OL,3,GNEWSA'Green lung' park to be created
OL,4,Anear city arena
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been revealed for what a
OL,7,Fdeveloper has described as the South
OL,8,FWest's biggest new urban park in 50
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FBrabazon Park will be a 15-acre green
OL,12,Fspace next to Bristol's 20,000-capacity
OL,13,FAviva Arena in the north of the city.
OL,15,FThe proposed park will include a large
OL,16,Flake, more than 500 trees, a children's
OL,17,Fplayground and outdoor facilities.
OL,19,FThe announcement about the park, which
OL,20,Fis expected to open in 2028, comes
OL,21,Fafter an opening date was revealed for
OL,22,Fthe nearby train station.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
